repeat_interleave_grad_n_1.h` 及其对应的host端tiling逻辑 `repeat_interleave_grad_tiling_arch35.cpp`，通过简化kernel中的reduce sum处理逻辑并调整tiling参数来修正精度。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`repeat_interleave_grad_n_1.h` 中 reduce sum 逻辑简化**：在 `RepeatInterleaveGradDimNOneDavid` 类中删除了7行、新增2行，主要涉及 `SingleRedeuceSum` 或 `BinaryRedeuceSum` 函数中数据搬运（`CopyInData`）与规约（`ReduceSum`）的对齐处理逻辑，移除了可能导致精度偏差的冗余或不正确的对齐计算，使 reduce 操作的数据范围与输入严格一致。\n\n- **`repeat_interleave_grad_tiling_arch35.cpp` 中 tiling 参数补充**：在host端 tiling 策略相关代码中新增1行，调整了 kernel 运行时所需的tiling参数传递，确保在 `lenN == 1` 路径下 kernel 能获取正确的buffer尺寸或对齐信息，配合kernel端的精度修复。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-26T10:32:28+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T10:32:28+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177249531,"discussion_id":"0c007e51fc7a9738a999a94862242301ff733561","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-26T10:35:32+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T10:35:32+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177272427,"discussion_id":"788d8984015801d55834b45266aa1d0d1b3a47b2","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-06-26T11:40:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T11:40:23+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c1b4096b0e7b44aa5961","login":"kevin_huang1234","object_id":"6822c1b4096b0e7b44aa5961","name":"kevin_huang1234","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/kevin_huang1234"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177290491,"discussion_id":"4ecc4867e4e82f7b782fb8ee78730a293ae54895","body":"/l